# Project Memory

**Purpose:** Project-specific conventions and preferences.

**Applies to:** All files in this project.

---

## Package Management

Use `pnpm` for all package management operations.

## Branding

The "Chironium" app name must always be displayed in all uppercase with small-caps style.

**Examples:**

```html
<span
  class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide"
  style="font-variant: small-caps"
  >CHIRONIUM</span
>
```

Or use the `AppName` component when available.

## Rule Quality

- Keep Cursor rules concise, minimal, and non-redundant to avoid context bloat.
- Treat non-standard conventions (e.g., scopes and verbs) as recommendations, not enforced requirements.

---

